[node name="Chains" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-180, -190)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("3_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the chains"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The chains[/b]

Four iron posts sunk into the floor, a chain on each, long enough to reach the seam and no further. The links are new, good iron, evenly drawn. The shackles at the ends are worn bright on the inside.

One shackle is smaller than the rest, cut down for a narrow wrist."
reexamine_text = "Four chains that reach the seam and no further. One shackle cut down small."

