[node name="SaltSackTags" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(330, -130)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("3_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the sack tags"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Sacks of white salt[/b]

The sacks are stacked to the roof, each sewn shut and tagged in the same neat hand: a weight, a date, and a mark. Most are marked with a cart. A few carry a small cross in a circle, the sign the Cathedral's almoners paint on their fever-boxes.

The salt has worked into the sacking. It is fine as flour, it bites the tongue, and it is in every crack of your hands before you step away."
reexamine_text = "Salt for the carts, and salt with the Cathedral's mark. It gets into every crack of your hands."

