[node name="DagnaSeal" type="Area2D" parent="StoryItems"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-430, 0)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("3_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the bricked gallery"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A bricked-up gallery[/b]

The west gallery ends in a wall of mortared stone, newer than the rock around it. Scratched into the mortar while it was wet: 'SEALED. D. Greystone. Never again.' Beyond it, faint as breath, you can hear water dripping in Greystone's own galleries.

On this side, someone has started to chip at the mortar near the floor, and given up, or been stopped."
reexamine_text = "Dagna's seal: 'Never again.' Someone on this side tried to chip through it."

